 #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bounded deference window for deprioritized waiters[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]deference[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Bounded deference window for deprioritized waiters' section: add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]priority-scaled, bounded hold-back gate so a below-default-priority [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]waiter does not claim a freshly freed runner slot while a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]better-priority agent is still finishing its dependency wait, with an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]early exit when no such agent exists.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]wait_priority_explicit marker symmetry[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]explicit-flag[dim] · [dim][/dim]after deference[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"'wait_priority_explicit marker symmetry' section: record whether a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parked agent's priority was user-specified or defaulted, mirroring [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wait_runners_explicit, so a marker written with the implicit default no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]longer shadows a later directive change.\"[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Surface wait priority in ACE[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]ace-display[dim] · [dim][/dim]after explicit-flag[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Surface wait priority in ACE' section: render the explicit wait [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]priority (and deference state) on queued agent list rows and in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent detail pane's Wait line, including the render-cache key fix.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Edit wait priority from the ACE wait modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wait-modal[dim] · [dim][/dim]after explicit-flag[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Edit wait priority from the ACE wait modal' section: add a priority [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]field to the ACE wait modal and its directive/marker persistence path, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and make sure editing other wait fields never clobbers an existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wait_priority.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-9k","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-9k.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-665d80eeb183e13f0a9f9daf8f0518ff","started_at":"2026-07-25T14:39:13.237386+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"7af5b5122c276bb8ed1a6bf53a98054170ca6be7edb6b7e098933ec3b49b1070","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9k.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9k.4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"1cc5089f3d46d8e50aa73e1c82ab3ebd7a10977ec6a2581391e42a9b53529787","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9k.4/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"9cd105124d26c1f4452a431f57d0a5dd6ff3102890d1cf829343bdda7dc31f79","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9k.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":154},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"6e241cc2c19ab8374e7dd3d27f8d92e36e6e74ebadfbd2aa0353a6472a4bb497","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9k.4/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4134},"state":{"digest":"e1f2a3a396b4e193333b49439e44f7a52b09ee5486c794e9069695f114d34b0d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9k.4/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-9k.4","local_name":"sase-9k.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-9k","agent_clan_generation":"20260725103